<title>HONG KONG: Min Xin appoints vice chairmen.</title>
<headline>Min Xin appoints vice chairmen.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Min Xin Holdings Ltd said it has appointed Chen Gui Zong and Xu Mei Xing as vice chairmen and executive directors with effect from January 17.</p>
<p>Min Xin said Lei Ping has resigned as vice chairman and executive director of the company with effect from the same date.</p>
<p>Min Xin engages in investment holding, property investment, finance, banking and insurance.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
